# ============================================================
# Media assets — never commit binary media to git
# ============================================================
# /media/ holds brand, app-store, play-store, marketing-site,
# and pitch-deck assets. They live on disk only; designers use
# Figma / Drive / S3 to collaborate, not git.
#
# See /media/README.md for the full spec.
/media/**
!/media/README.md
!/media/brand/README.md
!/media/app-store/README.md
!/media/play-store/README.md
!/media/marketing-site/README.md
!/media/pitch-deck/README.md
